<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="page-header">
  <h1>Personnel & Subjects</h1>
  <p>The individuals whose records, voices, and actions define Blackwood Institute.</p>
</div>

<section class="mt-4 mb-4">
  <div class="grid-2 stagger">
    <div class="card character-card">
      <div class="character-icon">🕵️</div>
      <h3>The Investigator</h3>
      <div class="character-role">Compliance Auditor • Player Protagonist</div>
      <p>
        An unnamed investigator deployed by the institutional oversight commission. Armed only with a flashlight, an audio recorder, and an objective checklist, the auditor must secure Elena Voss's classified files before the wrecking ball touches Blackwood's outer walls.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card character-card">
      <div class="character-icon">🔬</div>
      <h3>Dr. Elena Voss</h3>
      <div class="character-role">Lead Behavioral Researcher</div>
      <p>
        A brilliant, increasingly uncompromising clinical researcher whose life work collapsed inside Blackwood's walls. Voss never appears in person; she is reconstructed entirely through handwritten journals, scientific memos, audio reels, and marginal notes left in medical files.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card character-card">
      <div class="character-icon">🪪</div>
      <h3>Daniel Lowe ("Subject 7")</h3>
      <div class="character-role">Clinical Trial Volunteer</div>
      <p>
        A young man who entered the institute seeking treatment for chronic anxiety. Through successive isolation sessions in The Chamber, his identity was slowly stripped away. His presence lingers across hidden vent letters, scratched wall tallies ("STILL COUNTING"), and a torn two-piece photograph.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card character-card">
      <div class="character-icon">🗝️</div>
      <h3>The Caretaker</h3>
      <div class="character-role">Facility Custodian</div>
      <p>
        An elderly, mute caretaker who unlocks the rusted front gates, guides the investigator past barricaded stairwells, and leaves doors subtly ajar. His motives remain opaque until the final maintenance room is unlocked.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card character-card" style="grid-column: 1 / -1; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div class="character-icon">📞</div>
      <h3>Mr. Calloway</h3>
      <div class="character-role">Oversight Director • Voicemail Dispatcher</div>
      <p>
        Heard only via the crackling voicemail recording left on the lobby phone. Calloway represents the cold bureaucracy eager to sweep Blackwood's history under a legal settlement before demolition begins.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
